00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:38.980
The singular is fruct, fruct, fruct, fruct.

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:39.540
It means fruit.

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:40.720
Fruct, сладкий.

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:42.100
That means the fruit is sweet.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:43.580
Next is молоко.

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:44.460
молоко.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:45.200
молоко.

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:46.120
It means milk.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:47.280
Яблю молоко.

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:48.800
