00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:49.580
молоко.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:52.300
Sounds like a cow saying mo while drinking milk.

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:53.420
Now sir.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:53.900
Sir.

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:55.360
It means cheese.

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:56.500
Sir вкусный.

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:58.100
